---
title: Sequence 1 - POST /api/patients (Create Patient)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Admin/Doctor Client
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant MW as Auth + Role Middleware
    participant Policy as PatientPolicy
    participant Request as StorePatientRequest
    participant Service as PatientService
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>API: POST /api/patients {first_name, last_name, dob, ...}
    API->>MW: Verify Sanctum token
    MW-->>API: Authenticated (admin or doktor)
    API->>Request: Validate request data
    alt Validation fails
        Request-->>API: Validation errors
        API-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity
    else Validation passes
        Request-->>API: Validated data
        API->>Policy: authorize('create', Patient)
        Policy-->>API: Allowed
        API->>Service: createPatient(validatedData)
        Service->>DB: INSERT INTO patients
        DB-->>Service: Patient record
        Service->>DB: INSERT INTO patient_socioeconomic
        DB-->>Service: Socioeconomic record
        Service-->>API: Patient with socioeconomic
        API-->>Client: 201 PatientResource JSON
    end
